+// that formula at 22050 Hz, between a 39-tap half-band filter down and the
+// same filter up ("Reverb Buffer Resampling"); the SAS steps it once a sample
+// at its own 44100 Hz, which is what PPSSPP's output of a game shows (its
+// decay is the formula's at 44100 Hz; at 22050 Hz every echo comes twice as
+// late and the tail lasts three times as long). <prefix>_SAS_REVERB_SPU_RATE
+// runs the SPU's way instead. __sceSasRevType picks the preset (0 OFF, 1 ROOM,
+// 2 STUDIO SMALL, 3 STUDIO MEDIUM, 4 STUDIO LARGE, 5 HALL, 6 SPACE, 7 ECHO,
